    "bars": 4,
    "timeSig": "4/4",
    "homeKey": "C",
    "tempo": "mid",
    "moods": ["joyful", "hopeful", "rustic"],
    "genres": ["folk", "pop"],
    "instrument": "both",
    "notes": "The three primary chords in order. Between them I, IV and V contain every note of the major scale, which is why so much music needs nothing else. V to I at the end is the full cadence.",
