    "homeKey": "A",
    "tempo": "mid",
    "moods": ["driving", "carefree", "swaggering"],
    "genres": ["rock", "blues"],
    "instrument": "guitar",
    "notes": "Out to V then back down through IV, so the loop never resolves and rolls straight into the next repeat. Ending on IV is what keeps a riff turning rather than stopping.",
