    "tempo": "mid",
    "moods": ["nostalgic", "tender", "hopeful"],
    "genres": ["pop", "jazz"],
    "instrument": "both",
    "notes": "Each chord moves to one whose root is a fourth above, so the bass walks a chain of fifths back to the dominant. The standard turnaround for getting from the end of a section to the start of the next.",
